flowchart TD
    A[Approve project charter and goal] --> B[Document current-state journey]
    B --> C[Define operational and system requirements]
    C --> D[Define privacy and data-handling requirements]
    C --> E[Define accessibility and human fallback]
    D --> F[Sign off on requirements and safeguards]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Create pilot test plan]
    G --> H[Run authorized reviews and validation]
    H --> I[Resolve or disposition critical findings]
    I --> J{Readiness go/no-go}
    J -->|Go| K[Run approved pilot]
    J -->|No-go| L[Revise plan and revalidate]
    L --> G
    K --> M[Evaluate outcomes]
    M --> N[Publish lessons learned]
